WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.500
Three creatures, three berries.
Each can walk at most three spaces.

2
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.700
Fern starts at 4. Berry 7 is the only
one Fern can reach in three steps.

3
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:09.700
Moss starts at 5. With berry 7 gone,
the nearest remaining berry is 8.

4
00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:12.500
Pip starts at 6. The berry left at 9
is exactly three spaces away.

5
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:17.000
Fern: 4 → 7. Moss: 5 → 8. Pip: 6 → 9.
Every creature walked three spaces.

